# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please **do not** open a public issue. Report privately via GitHub
"Report a vulnerability" (Security tab) or contact the maintainers
(@{{owner_handle}}). We aim to acknowledge reports within 3 working days.

## Supported versions

Only the latest release on `main` receives security fixes.

## Practices in this repository

- Secrets are never committed; `gitleaks` runs in pre-commit and CI.
- Dependencies are updated automatically (Dependabot) and scanned in CI.
- Code scanning (CodeQL) runs on every PR to `main`.
